  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>No war was ever won without casualties.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Motive 5 ranks, ability to manifest a veil companion or champion constellation.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you have a veil companion or champion constellation you manifested yourself adjacent to you and become the target of an attack, you may attempt a Sense Motive check with a DC equal to the attack roll to anticipate the attack’s trajectory and redirect the attack to the champion or companion instead, comparing the attack roll to its AC normally as though it had been the original target of the attack (even if the attack would not normally have been able to reach the champion). You may invest essence into this feat, gaining a +1 insight bonus on Sense Motive checks per point of essence invested.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
